{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手范卓賢（Jacky Fan）近日推出新歌《惡性循環》，昨天（18日）舉行音樂分享會，歌迷以及大批圍觀者守候，Jacky唱出多首自己作品，包括：《淚光萬歲》、《三尖八角》等，同時獻唱偶像歌曲《百年樹木》及《戀愛腦之死》。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T07:19:14.795662+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:02:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:37:43.051635+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T07:17:39.540777+00:00","content_hash":"7d96f112c9e110cd8f82526e5122138e4b06671bf44126e910600599eedeb6c7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}